{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54597","headline":"兵要望江南 占虹霓第七（京本作「占虹第九」○十一首） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占虹霓第七（京本作「占虹第九」○十一首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虹如晕，更复（京本作「或」）似弓形。\n有若白虹形断续，兼之五六见城营，皆主血光成（京本作「生」。\n京本注：「或见五六月」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}